4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W3heDWXsHPsQ7kNvwHWYfw0&_nc_oc=AdqppzB8CCviIbqkSqyGVcBsTTzo49vqznKGsLwYtTxEUI3MEeXwpW_6MoWY5hkvAU4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8M2H9bqp1_kpISPQOexRGv9zmJjvliI2pNcUuReRSoPg&oe=6A2EA6D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TMopf9Gy8R8Q7kNvwE54pMo&_nc_oc=Adog091Z_LLYxT4hLUNt8AzQ0-AX_EqQT8GJMe-HYDbi5VPGPzx4hzXrWmbtx06Ikmo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-h2xI1oRlJUM7YIwmw7Ux5N3GDSgqt1rZWhE_xbKQnvQ&oe=6A2EABB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mC7kdZozQ08Q7kNvwE7ayJT&_nc_oc=AdoUeGe13MbpDkydGY7EhPeuxZWO523c60Z_9Ni25LoeXF8lya_Fn0LLxZamNVqgcZI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af94y69KSPCOq-MXg526Xb75zS64uD-YewH6KFiqmN3tnQ&oe=6A2EB955"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p